{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghuLa3SDWTT1yEpFzbro","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"For this high-spin octahedral Mn²⁺ (d⁵) analysis, **Dq ≈ 580 cm⁻¹ (10Dq ≈ 5800 cm⁻¹), B ≈ 722 cm⁻¹ and C ≈ 3155 cm⁻¹**. I got these by solving the full d⁵ Tanabe–Sugano (strong-field) matrices by hand; no tools were used.\n\n**Method**\n\nAll energies are measured from the ⁶A₁g ground state.\n\n1. **⁴E_g(G) band.** Its energy does not depend on the field strength: E = 10B + 5C = 23 000 cm⁻¹. This gives C = 4600 − 2B.\n\n2. **⁴T₁g band.** It comes from a 3×3 matrix built on the t₂⁴e, t₂³e² and t₂²e³ configurations. The diagonal terms are −10Dq + 10B + 6C, 19B + 7C and +10Dq + 10B + 6C. The off-diagonal terms are −3√2B, −3√2B and C (outer pair).\n   - Check: at Dq = 0 this matrix gives the free-ion terms ⁴G (10B + 5C), ⁴P (7B + 7C) and ⁴F (22B + 7C).\n\n3. **⁴T₂g band.** Its 3×3 matrix has diagonal terms −10Dq + 18B + 6C, 13B + 5C and +10Dq + 18B + 6C. The off-diagonal terms are √6B, √6B and −4B − C (outer pair).\n   - Check: at Dq = 0 this matrix gives ⁴G, ⁴D and ⁴F.\n\n4. **Fitting.** I substituted C = 4600 − 2B and required the lowest root of the ⁴T₁g matrix to be 19 240 cm⁻¹ and the lowest root of the ⁴T₂g matrix to be 21 890 cm⁻¹. Each condition gives (10Dq)² as a function of B, and the two must agree:\n   - At B = 700: the ⁴T₁ condition gives 10Dq = 5846; the ⁴T₂ condition gives 5750.\n   - At B = 750: they give 5735 and 5854.\n   - At B = 722: they give 5797.6 and 5796.3, so the curves meet at B ≈ 722.\n\n**Result**\n\n- 10Dq ≈ 5800 cm⁻¹, so Dq ≈ 580 cm⁻¹\n- B ≈ 722 cm⁻¹\n- C = 4600 − 2B ≈ 3155 cm⁻¹, so C/B ≈ 4.4\n\nThese values fall in the normal range for Mn²⁺ with bromide ligands: the field is weak, and B is reduced from the free-ion value of about 960 cm⁻¹.\n\n{\"Dq\": 580, \"B\": 722, \"C\": 3155, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Fitted the d5 Tanabe-Sugano matrices exactly, using the field-independent 4E band (10B+5C) as one constraint.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":816,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":816,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0f0b5ffe-f786-4fde-bbcc-9d0e21ea8eb0","uuid":"feb76ea3-c34d-442c-ae42-ee957c4e3633","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:40:52.648Z","request_id":"req_011CghuLZfbvMT9sj7wHSdeN"}
